    {
     "t": "event-field",
     "field": "title",
     "text": "Hellavated Baja Blastoff Pop-Up",
     "level": 1
    },
    {
     "t": "event-field",
     "field": "datetime",
     "text": "June 27, 2026\n@ 12:00 pm\n- 2:00 pm"
    },
    {
     "t": "image",
     "ref": "assets/source/b74b6f8a-hellavated-baja-blastoff_200px.png",
     "srcUrl": "https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/hellavated-baja-blastoff_200px.png?lossy=2&strip=0&webp=1",
     "alt": "Hellavated brand and NEW Limited-time Drop Flavor - Baja Blastoff at Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleet.",
     "w": 200,
     "h": 238,
     "kind": "event-image"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Learn more about the Hellavated brand that offers great products, such as their Vape Cartridges, Infused Pre-Rolls, and more!"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Kick it into HIGH gear. Juicy Stickz combines whole bud flower with our proprietary infusion of melted diamonds, botanical terpenes, and kief to create a potent flavor explosion, packaged expertly in a 0.75g pre-roll. You can expect a smooth, tasty burn all the way to the end that delivers on potency and is packed with flavor. Available in singles or 5-packs.</p><p>Vapes will never be the same. Hellavated carts combine the unmatched potency of distillate with our unique hella-tasty natural terpene blends to deliver an out-of-this-world experience that is sure to make your mouth water. You can expect maximum flavor and a smooth and easy vaping experience no matter which Hellavated vape you pick for the day’s adventures.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Be one of the FIRST 20 Hellavated fans at our exclusive Baja Blastoff Pop-Up and receive a STASH Can entry to WIN a $500 Taco Bell Gift Card!"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><a href=\"https://www.hellavated.com/products/limited-time-only-flavors/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">No purchase necessary to enter.</a></p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "NEW FLAVOR! LIMITED TIME DROP!"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>. <img src=\"assets/source/9259cb4c-Hellavated_OR_cartridge_Baja-Blastoff.png\" alt=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" width=\"220\" height=\"386\" title=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" data-source-url=\"https://www.hellavated.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Hellavated_OR_cartridge_Baja-Blastoff.png\"> <img src=\"assets/source/2e5b1668-Hellavated_OR_JuicyStickz_Baja-Blastoff-scaled.png\" alt=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" width=\"99\" height=\"374\" title=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" data-source-url=\"https://www.hellavated.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Hellavated_OR_JuicyStickz_Baja-Blastoff-scaled.png\"></p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 5,
     "text": "Available on 6/27/26 – Baja Blastoff takes the iconic tropical soda flavor and launches it into another dimension. This limited-edition release delivers a rush of sweet lime and bright citrus notes, capturing that unmistakable nostalgic flavor with a cosmic twist."
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><a href=\"/brands/hellavated/\"><img src=\"assets/source/d151dbdc-Shop-Now-Button-200px.png\" alt=\"Shop Now at Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleet, MA\" width=\"223\" height=\"77\" title=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" data-source-url=\"https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Shop-Now-Button-200px.png?lossy=2&amp;strip=0&amp;webp=1\"></a></p>"
    },
